<title>ITALY: Fiat announces Comau-Berto Lamet merger.</title>
<headline>Fiat announces Comau-Berto Lamet merger.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Fiat has decided on a merger of two of its units, robotics company Comau Finanziaria and vehicle components group Berto Lamet.</p>
<p>A Fiat statement said that the new company would be called Comau SpA and the plan would be put to a shareholders meeting on November 6.</p>
<p>Earlier today, shares in Comau Finansiaria and Berto Lamet were suspended on the Milan bourse pending the announcement.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +39 266129502</p>
</text>
